## 🐳 Docker Images

This release is available as Docker images for multiple architectures:

```bash
# Latest version
docker pull guidedtraffic/jinja-template-operator:latest

# Specific version
docker pull guidedtraffic/jinja-template-operator:{{version}}
```

**Supported platforms:** linux/amd64, linux/arm64

## 📥 Download Assets

Pre-built binaries and coverage reports are attached to this release:
- `jinja-template-operator-{{gitTag}}-linux-amd64` - Main operator binary
- `coverage-{{gitTag}}.out` - Coverage profile (Go format)
- `coverage-{{gitTag}}.txt` - Coverage report (human readable)

